Gitea plugin for JetBrains IDEs

Parts of this plugin mirror the structure and behavior of the GitHub
pull request support and the code review UI library in IntelliJ IDEA
Community Edition (https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community, build
252.28539.54), where the equivalent library API is not public:

- pullrequest/review/editor/*: modeled on
  plugins/github/github-core/src/org/jetbrains/plugins/github/pullrequest/ui/editor
  and .../pullrequest/ui/comment
- pullrequest/review/LineMapping.kt: replaces
  platform/collaboration-tools/.../ui/codereview/editor/ReviewInEditorUtil.kt

